feedback.template:
This is attempt ${{ feedback.attempt }} of ${{ feedback.max_attempts }}. A quality judge rejected your previous draft:
${{ feedback.issues }}

Previous draft:
${{ feedback.prior_output }}

Revise it to satisfy the rubric.

config.prompt:
Research this topic and report the key facts, drawing on the retrieved source material.

Topic: ${{ run.params.topic }}

Retrieved documents:
${{ steps.search.output.results }}

Review the latest draft against the topic and the research brief:

${{ steps.draft.output.text }}

Output JSON like {"verdict": "approve"} or {"verdict": "revise", "notes": ["..."]}.
